By submitting contributions (including but not limited to agent code, model weights, configurations,
and documentation) to Subnet 118 ("SN118" / "Ditto"), Contributor executes this Contributor License
Agreement using their Bittensor hotkey cryptographic signature.

Contributor hereby grants to Ditto, its operators, and its successors a perpetual, worldwide,
